    - Term: The crest was carved deep into its heartwood... He passed that grove
        alive, and kept climbing. His trail leads to the Tower Outskirts. Rest first,
        child.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The crest was carved deep into its heartwood... He passed that grove alive,
        and kept climbing. His trail leads to the Tower Outskirts. Rest first, child.
      - "\uBB38\uC7A5\uC774 \uADF8 \uC2EC\uC7AC \uAE4A\uC219\uC774 \uC0C8\uACA8\uC838
        \uC788\uC5C8\uAD6C\uB098... \uADF8\uB294 \uADF8 \uC232\uC744 \uC0B4\uC544\uC11C
        \uC9C0\uB098 \uACC4\uC18D \uC62C\uB77C\uAC14\uB2E4. \uBC1C\uC790\uCDE8\uB294
        \uD0D1 \uADFC\uAD50\uB85C \uC774\uC5B4\uC9C4\uB2E4. \uC6B0\uC120 \uC26C\uC5B4\uB77C,
        \uC544\uC774\uC57C."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
