      Languages:
      - The Tower. It swallows the sky above the village.
      - "\uD0D1. \uB9C8\uC744 \uC704 \uD558\uB298\uC744 \uC0BC\uD0A4\uACE0 \uC11C
        \uC788\uB2E4."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Father climbed it to find a cure for me... and never came back down.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Father climbed it to find a cure for me... and never came back down.
      - "\uC544\uBC84\uC9C0\uB294 \uB098\uB97C \uACE0\uCE60 \uBC29\uBC95\uC744 \uCC3E\uC73C\uB7EC
        \uC800\uAE30\uC5D0 \uC62C\uB790\uB2E4... \uADF8\uB9AC\uACE0 \uB3CC\uC544\uC624\uC9C0
        \uC54A\uC558\uB2E4."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: This brooch was his. If I fall up there, it will carry me home.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - This brooch was his. If I fall up there, it will carry me home.
      - "\uC774 \uBE0C\uB85C\uCE58\uB294 \uC544\uBC84\uC9C0\uC758 \uAC83. \uC800
        \uC704\uC5D0\uC11C \uC4F0\uB7EC\uC838\uB3C4, \uC774\uAC83\uC774 \uB098\uB97C
        \uC9D1\uC73C\uB85C \uB370\uB824\uB2E4\uC904 \uAC70\uC57C."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Whatever waits on the higher floors - I'm going to find him.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Whatever waits on the higher floors - I'm going to find him.
      - "\uC704\uCE35\uC5D0 \uBB34\uC5C7\uC774 \uAE30\uB2E4\uB9AC\uB4E0 - \uB098\uB294
        \uC544\uBC84\uC9C0\uB97C \uCC3E\uC744 \uAC70\uC57C."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Ah... you wear his brooch. So you are the child he spoke of.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Ah... you wear his brooch. So you are the child he spoke of.
      - "\uC544... \uADF8 \uC0AC\uB78C\uC758 \uBE0C\uB85C\uCE58\uB97C \uB2EC\uACE0
        \uC788\uAD6C\uB098. \uB124\uAC00 \uADF8\uAC00 \uB9D0\uD558\uB358 \uC544\uC774\uB85C\uAD6C\uB098."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Ask what you must, explorer.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Ask what you must, explorer.
      - "\uBB3C\uC744 \uAC83\uC774 \uC788\uC73C\uBA74 \uBB3B\uAC70\uB77C, \uD0D0\uD5D8\uAC00."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Is there anything I can do?
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Is there anything I can do?
      - "\uC81C\uAC00 \uB3C4\uC6B8 \uC77C\uC774 \uC788\uC744\uAE4C\uC694?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: There is. Let me tell you what the hunters found.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - There is. Let me tell you what the hunters found.
      - "\uC788\uC9C0. \uC0AC\uB0E5\uAFBC\uB4E4\uC774 \uCC3E\uC544\uB0B8 \uAC83\uC744
        \uB4E4\uB824\uC8FC\uB9C8."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: About my father...
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - About my father...
      - "\uC544\uBC84\uC9C0\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574\uC11C..."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: He passed through here many winters ago, set on reaching the top.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - He passed through here many winters ago, set on reaching the top.
      - "\uC5EC\uB7EC \uD574 \uC804 \uACA8\uC6B8, \uAF2D\uB300\uAE30\uC5D0 \uB2FF\uACA0\uB2E4\uBA70
        \uC774\uACF3\uC744 \uC9C0\uB098\uAC14\uC9C0."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Rumor says the Tower changed him. That he now guards one of its gates.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Rumor says the Tower changed him. That he now guards one of its gates.
      - "\uD0D1\uC774 \uADF8\uB97C \uBC14\uAFD4 \uB193\uC558\uB2E4\uB294 \uC18C\uBB38\uC774
        \uC788\uB2E8\uB2E4. \uC9C0\uAE08\uC740 \uD0D1\uC758 \uBB38 \uD558\uB098\uB97C
        \uC9C0\uD0A4\uACE0 \uC788\uB2E4\uB354\uAD6C\uB098."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Why is climbing so hard?
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Why is climbing so hard?
      - "\uC65C \uC624\uB974\uAE30\uAC00 \uC774\uB807\uAC8C \uD798\uB4E0\uAC00\uC694?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: The Tower presses on those who climb. We call it the ascent load.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The Tower presses on those who climb. We call it the ascent load.
      - "\uD0D1\uC740 \uC624\uB974\uB294 \uC774\uB97C \uC9D3\uB204\uB978\uB2E8\uB2E4.
        \uC6B0\uB9AC\uB294 \uADF8\uAC83\uC744 \uC0C1\uC2B9 \uBD80\uD558\uB77C \uBD80\uB974\uC9C0."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Each floor weighs more. Earn higher ranks as an explorer and you will
        bear it.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Each floor weighs more. Earn higher ranks as an explorer and you will bear
        it.
      - "\uCE35\uACC4\uB9C8\uB2E4 \uB354 \uBB34\uAC70\uC6CC\uC9C4\uB2E4. \uD0D0\uD5D8\uAC00\uB85C\uC11C
        \uB4F1\uAE09\uC744 \uC62C\uB9AC\uBA74 \uACAC\uB51C \uC218 \uC788\uC744 \uAC8C\uB2E4."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Going down is always free. Coming back up is the test.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Going down is always free. Coming back up is the test.
      - "\uB0B4\uB824\uAC00\uB294 \uAE38\uC740 \uC5B8\uC81C\uB098 \uAC70\uC800\uB2E4.
        \uB2E4\uC2DC \uC624\uB974\uB294 \uAC83\uC774 \uC2DC\uD5D8\uC774\uC9C0."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: What does the brooch do?
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - What does the brooch do?
      - "\uBE0C\uB85C\uCE58\uB294 \uBB34\uC2A8 \uD798\uC774 \uC788\uB098\uC694?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: If you fall, it pulls you back to this village.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - If you fall, it pulls you back to this village.
      - "\uC4F0\uB7EC\uC9C0\uBA74 \uB108\uB97C \uC774 \uB9C8\uC744\uB85C \uB04C\uC5B4\uB2F9\uACA8
        \uC900\uB2E8\uB2E4."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: What you wear stays with you. Loose spoils... the Tower may keep.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - What you wear stays with you. Loose spoils... the Tower may keep.
      - "\uBAB8\uC5D0 \uAC78\uCE5C \uAC83\uC740 \uB0A8\uC9C0\uB9CC, \uD769\uC5B4\uC9C4
        \uC804\uB9AC\uD488\uC740... \uD0D1\uC774 \uAC00\uC838\uAC08\uC9C0\uB3C4 \uBAA8\uB974\uC9C0."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: I should go.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - I should go.
      - "\uC774\uB9CC \uAC00 \uBCFC\uAC8C\uC694."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Return alive. That is all an old man asks.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Return alive. That is all an old man asks.
      - "\uC0B4\uC544\uC11C \uB3CC\uC544\uC624\uB108\uB77C. \uB299\uC740\uC774\uC758
        \uBC14\uB78C\uC740 \uADF8\uAC83\uBFD0\uC774\uB2E4."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Steel's hot. What do you need?
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Steel's hot. What do you need?
      - "\uC1E0\uAC00 \uB2EC\uAD88\uC84C\uC5B4. \uBB50\uAC00 \uD544\uC694\uD574?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: How do I get stronger gear?
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - How do I get stronger gear?
      - "\uB354 \uAC15\uD55C \uC7A5\uBE44\uB294 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uC5BB\uC8E0?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Bring me Floor Crystals. I can temper your gear up to +10.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Bring me Floor Crystals. I can temper your gear up to +10.
      - "\uCE35\uACC4 \uACB0\uC815\uC744 \uAC00\uC838\uC640. \uC7A5\uBE44\uB97C +10\uAE4C\uC9C0
        \uB2F4\uAE08\uC9C8\uD574 \uC8FC\uC9C0."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Past +5 the metal fights back. Failures happen - don't cry about it.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Past +5 the metal fights back. Failures happen - don't cry about it.
      - "+5\uB97C \uB118\uC73C\uBA74 \uC1E0\uAC00 \uBC84\uD168. \uC2E4\uD328\uB3C4
        \uD558\uC9C0 - \uC6B8\uC9C0\uB294 \uB9D0\uACE0."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Tell me about gear sets.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Tell me about gear sets.
      - "\uC138\uD2B8 \uC7A5\uBE44\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uC54C\uB824 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Pieces cut from the same monster resonate when worn together.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Pieces cut from the same monster resonate when worn together.
      - "\uAC19\uC740 \uBAAC\uC2A4\uD130\uC5D0\uAC8C\uC11C \uC5BB\uC740 \uC870\uAC01\uC740
        \uD568\uAED8 \uC785\uC73C\uBA74 \uACF5\uBA85\uD558\uC9C0."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Two, three, four pieces - each wakes a stronger bonus. Hunt for the full
        set.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Two, three, four pieces - each wakes a stronger bonus. Hunt for the full
        set.
      - "\uB458, \uC14B, \uB137 - \uBAA8\uC77C\uC218\uB85D \uB354 \uAC15\uD55C \uD6A8\uACFC\uAC00
        \uAE68\uC5B4\uB098. \uC138\uD2B8\uB97C \uB2E4 \uBAA8\uC544 \uBD10."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Thanks, Brann.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Thanks, Brann.
      - "\uACE0\uB9C8\uC6CC\uC694, \uBE0C\uB780."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Don't break it on the first floor.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Don't break it on the first floor.
      - "1\uCE35\uACC4\uC5D0\uC11C \uBD80\uB7EC\uB728\uB9AC\uC9C4 \uB9C8\uB77C."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Welcome! Potions, food, odds and ends - fresh from the lower floors.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Welcome! Potions, food, odds and ends - fresh from the lower floors.
      - "\uC5B4\uC11C \uC640\uC694! \uBB3C\uC57D, \uC74C\uC2DD, \uC7A1\uB3D9\uC0AC\uB2C8
        - \uC544\uB798\uCE35\uC5D0\uC11C \uAC13 \uAC00\uC838\uC628 \uBB3C\uAC74\uC774\uC5D0\uC694."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Any advice for the forest?
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Any advice for the forest?
      - "\uC232\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574 \uC870\uC5B8\uD574 \uC904 \uAC8C \uC788\uB098\uC694?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: The outskirts are calm by day. At night the rats come out, big ones.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The outskirts are calm by day. At night the rats come out, big ones.
      - "\uC678\uACFD\uC740 \uB0AE\uC5D4 \uC870\uC6A9\uD574\uC694. \uBC24\uC774 \uB418\uBA74
        \uC950\uB4E4\uC774 \uB098\uC640\uC694, \uC544\uC8FC \uD070 \uB188\uB4E4\uC774\uC694."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Carry stew. A full belly has saved more explorers than any sword.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Carry stew. A full belly has saved more explorers than any sword.
      - "\uC2A4\uD29C\uB97C \uCC59\uAE30\uC138\uC694. \uB4E0\uB4E0\uD55C \uBC30\uAC00
        \uC5B4\uB5A4 \uAC80\uBCF4\uB2E4 \uB9CE\uC740 \uD0D0\uD5D8\uAC00\uB97C \uC0B4\uB838\uAC70\uB4E0\uC694."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: What sells well?
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - What sells well?
      - "\uBB50\uAC00 \uC798 \uD314\uB824\uC694?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Relics from higher floors fetch a fortune. Monster parts, not so much.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Relics from higher floors fetch a fortune. Monster parts, not so much.
      - "\uC704\uCE35 \uC720\uBB3C\uC740 \uD070\uB3C8\uC774 \uB3FC\uC694. \uBAAC\uC2A4\uD130
        \uBD80\uC0B0\uBB3C\uC740 \uADF8\uB2E4\uC9C0\uC694."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: See you later.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - See you later.
      - "\uB2E4\uC74C\uC5D0 \uBD10\uC694."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Come back with coin!
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Come back with coin!
      - "\uB3C8 \uBC8C\uC5B4\uC11C \uB610 \uC640\uC694!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ...None... shall pass... the gate.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - ...None... shall pass... the gate.
      - "...\uC544\uBB34\uB3C4... \uC774 \uBB38\uC744... \uC9C0\uB098\uC9C0 \uBABB\uD55C\uB2E4."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: A giant in armor, older than the ruins around it.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A giant in armor, older than the ruins around it.
      - "\uAC11\uC637\uC744 \uB450\uB978 \uAC70\uC778. \uC8FC\uC704\uC758 \uD3D0\uD5C8\uBCF4\uB2E4\uB3C4
        \uC624\uB798\uB418\uC5B4 \uBCF4\uC778\uB2E4."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: That crest on its chest... it's the same pattern as my brooch.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - That crest on its chest... it's the same pattern as my brooch.
      - "\uAC00\uC2B4\uC758 \uC800 \uBB38\uC7A5... \uB0B4 \uBE0C\uB85C\uCE58\uC640
        \uAC19\uC740 \uBB34\uB2AC\uC57C."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ...Father?
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - ...Father?
      - "...\uC544\uBC84\uC9C0?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ...Turn... back...
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - ...Turn... back...
      - "...\uB3CC\uC544... \uAC00\uB77C..."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: No. Whatever you are, I'm going up.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - No. Whatever you are, I'm going up.
      - "\uC544\uB2C8. \uB2F9\uC2E0\uC774 \uBB34\uC5C7\uC774\uB4E0, \uB098\uB294
        \uC62C\uB77C\uAC08 \uAC70\uC57C."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: FLOOR 1 THE FOREST
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "FLOOR 1  \xB7  THE FOREST"
      - "1\uCE35\uACC4  \xB7  \uC232"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: UP DOWN LEFT RIGHT adjust ESC back
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "UP/DOWN  \xB7  LEFT/RIGHT adjust  \xB7  ESC back"
      - "\uC704/\uC544\uB798  \xB7  \uC88C/\uC6B0 \uC870\uC808  \xB7  ESC \uB4A4\uB85C"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: UP DOWN SELECT ENTER ESC resume
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "UP/DOWN  \xB7  SELECT / ENTER  \xB7  ESC resume"
      - "\uC704/\uC544\uB798  \xB7  \uC120\uD0DD / ENTER  \xB7  ESC \uACC4\uC18D"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: ENRAGED Phase 2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "ENRAGED \u2014 Phase 2"
      - "\uACA9\uB178 \u2014 2\uD398\uC774\uC988"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: FRENZY Phase 3
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "FRENZY \u2014 Phase 3"
      - "\uAD11\uD3ED \u2014 3\uD398\uC774\uC988"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'Unique:'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Unique: '
      - "\uACE0\uC720: "
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'Reward:'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Reward: '
      - "\uBCF4\uC0C1: "
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Show me you can work a forge craft any 2 pieces of gear at the smiths.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "Show me you can work a forge \u2014 craft any 2 pieces of gear at the smiths."
      - "\uD654\uB85C\uB97C \uB2E4\uB8F0 \uC904 \uC544\uB294\uC9C0 \uBCF4\uC5EC \uC918
        \u2014 \uB300\uC7A5\uAC04\uC5D0\uC11C \uC7A5\uBE44 2\uAC1C\uB97C \uB9CC\uB4E4\uC5B4
        \uBD10."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Hunters found strange marks carved on the trees of the Deep Forest the
        same crest as your brooch. An Ancient Ent has taken root over that grove.
        Defeat it, and see what your father left behind.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "Hunters found strange marks carved on the trees of the Deep Forest \u2014
        the same crest as your brooch. An Ancient Ent has taken root over that grove.
        Defeat it, and see what your father left behind."
      - "\uC0AC\uB0E5\uAFBC\uB4E4\uC774 \uAE4A\uC740 \uC232 \uB098\uBB34\uC5D0 \uC0C8\uACA8\uC9C4
        \uC774\uC0C1\uD55C \uBB38\uC591\uC744 \uCC3E\uC558\uB2E8\uB2E4. \uB124 \uBE0C\uB85C\uCE58\uC640
        \uAC19\uC740 \uBB38\uC7A5\uC774\uC57C. \uADF8 \uC232\uC5D0\uB294 \uACE0\uB300
        \uC5D4\uD2B8\uAC00 \uBFCC\uB9AC\uB97C \uB0B4\uB838\uC9C0. \uADF8\uAC83\uC744
        \uC4F0\uB7EC\uB728\uB9AC\uACE0, \uB124 \uC544\uBC84\uC9C0\uAC00 \uB0A8\uAE34
        \uAC83\uC744 \uD655\uC778\uD558\uB834."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Basic Gear
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Basic Gear
      - "\uAE30\uBCF8 \uC7A5\uBE44"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Nature's Reward
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Nature's Reward
      - "\uC790\uC5F0\uC758 \uBCF4\uB2F5"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Cliffwalker's Vow
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
