    - Term: Beyond the swamp lie the Tower Outskirts. The stones there walk, they
        say golems that guard the old ruins. If your father carved his crest on the
        trees, he surely marked the stones too. Break 12 golems and read what they
        carry.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "Beyond the swamp lie the Tower Outskirts. The stones there walk, they say
        \u2014 golems that guard the old ruins. If your father carved his crest on
        the trees, he surely marked the stones too. Break 12 golems and read what
        they carry."
      - "\uB2AA \uB108\uBA38\uC5D0\uB294 \uD0D1 \uADFC\uAD50\uAC00 \uC788\uB2E8\uB2E4.
        \uADF8\uACF3\uC5D0\uC120 \uB3CC\uC774 \uAC77\uB294\uB2E4\uB354\uAD6C\uB098
        \u2014 \uC61B \uD3D0\uD5C8\uB97C \uC9C0\uD0A4\uB294 \uACE8\uB818\uB4E4\uC774\uC9C0.
        \uB124 \uC544\uBC84\uC9C0\uAC00 \uB098\uBB34\uC5D0 \uBB38\uC7A5\uC744 \uC0C8\uACBC\uB2E4\uBA74
        \uB3CC\uC5D0\uB3C4 \uBD84\uBA85 \uD754\uC801\uC744 \uB0A8\uACBC\uC744 \uAC8C\uB2E4.
        \uACE8\uB818 12\uAE30\uB97C \uBD80\uC218\uACE0 \uADF8\uB4E4\uC774 \uD488\uC740
        \uAC83\uC744 \uC77D\uC5B4 \uBCF4\uB834."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Defeat 12 golems in the Tower Outskirts.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Defeat 12 golems in the Tower Outskirts.
      - "\uD0D1 \uADFC\uAD50\uC758 \uACE8\uB818 12\uAE30\uB97C \uC4F0\uB7EC\uB728\uB9AC\uC138\uC694."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: The same crest, worn into the golems' cores... as if they were made to
        guard something he swore to protect. Every mark points to the Tower gate.
        Something waits there, child. Something old.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The same crest, worn into the golems' cores... as if they were made to guard
        something he swore to protect. Every mark points to the Tower gate. Something
        waits there, child. Something old.
      - "\uACE8\uB818\uC758 \uD575\uC5D0 \uB2F3\uC544 \uC788\uB294 \uAC19\uC740 \uBB38\uC7A5\uC774\uB77C...
        \uB9C8\uCE58 \uADF8\uAC00 \uC9C0\uD0A4\uACA0\uB2E4\uACE0 \uB9F9\uC138\uD55C
        \uBB34\uC5B8\uAC00\uB97C \uC9C0\uD0A4\uB824\uACE0 \uB9CC\uB4E4\uC5B4\uC9C4
        \uAC83 \uAC19\uAD6C\uB098. \uBAA8\uB4E0 \uD754\uC801\uC774 \uD0D1\uC758 \uBB38\uC744
        \uAC00\uB9AC\uD0A8\uB2E4. \uADF8\uACF3\uC5D0 \uBB34\uC5B8\uAC00\uAC00 \uAE30\uB2E4\uB9AC\uACE0
        \uC788\uB2E4, \uC544\uC774\uC57C. \uC544\uC8FC \uC624\uB798\uB41C \uBB34\uC5B8\uAC00\uAC00."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Father's Traces III
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Father's Traces III
      - "\uC544\uBC84\uC9C0\uC758 \uD754\uC801 III"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: An armored giant stands before the Tower gate. No one who faced it has
        returned to tell us its face. If you mean to follow him upward, you must
        pass it.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - An armored giant stands before the Tower gate. No one who faced it has returned
        to tell us its face. If you mean to follow him upward, you must pass it.
      - "\uD0D1\uC758 \uBB38 \uC55E\uC5D0 \uAC11\uC637 \uC785\uC740 \uAC70\uC778\uC774
        \uC11C \uC788\uB2E4. \uADF8\uAC83\uACFC \uB9DE\uC120 \uC790 \uC911 \uADF8
        \uC5BC\uAD74\uC744 \uC804\uD558\uB7EC \uB3CC\uC544\uC628 \uC774\uB294 \uC5C6\uC5C8\uC9C0.
        \uADF8\uB97C \uB530\uB77C \uC704\uB85C \uC624\uB974\uB824\uAC70\uB4E0 \uADF8\uAC83\uC744
        \uC9C0\uB098\uC57C \uD55C\uB2E4."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Defeat the Gatekeeper of the Tower.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Defeat the Gatekeeper of the Tower.
      - "\uD0D1\uC758 \uBB38\uC9C0\uAE30\uB97C \uC4F0\uB7EC\uB728\uB9AC\uC138\uC694."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: It wore his crest on its chest...? No I will not guess at what I cannot
        know. The gate is open now. Whatever is up there, your brooch will bring
        you home. Go, and come back.
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "It wore his crest on its chest...? No \u2014 I will not guess at what I
        cannot know. The gate is open now. Whatever is up there, your brooch will
        bring you home. Go, and come back."
      - "\uAC00\uC2B4\uC5D0 \uADF8\uC758 \uBB38\uC7A5\uC744 \uB2EC\uACE0 \uC788\uC5C8\uB2E4\uACE0...?
        \uC544\uB2C8\uB2E4 \u2014 \uC54C \uC218 \uC5C6\uB294 \uAC83\uC744 \uC9D0\uC791\uD558\uC9C0\uB294
        \uC54A\uC73C\uB9C8. \uC774\uC81C \uBB38\uC774 \uC5F4\uB838\uB2E4. \uC800
        \uC704\uC5D0 \uBB34\uC5C7\uC774 \uC788\uB4E0, \uBE0C\uB85C\uCE58\uAC00 \uB108\uB97C
        \uC9D1\uC73C\uB85C \uB370\uB824\uB2E4\uC904 \uAC8C\uB2E4. \uAC00\uAC70\uB77C,
        \uADF8\uB9AC\uACE0 \uB3CC\uC544\uC624\uB108\uB77C."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
